erful color palette to evoke both wonder and dread. Levels feel alive, each location tells its own silent story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146120/extras/db39ccec52bdd06d7fd297936d913e56.poster.avif?t=1780523607\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146120/extras/db39ccec52bdd06d7fd297936d913e56.webm?t=1780523607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ayasa: Shadows of Silence</strong> invites players into a world where the smallest act can change everything and where the end depends on the heart that guides your choices. </p>",
